From: rakesh chanda <rakesh.chanda@adtran.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 13:19:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SDG-8679 Disable hardware acceleration for multicast traffic

Commenting multicast handler to avoid invoking multicast hwnat hook so that multicast traffic is processed by CPU.

Signed-off-by: rakesh chanda <rakesh.chanda@adtran.com>
---

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/arht_dp_api.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/arht_dp_api.c
@@ -1372,7 +1372,7 @@ static void airoha_get_entry_bind(u32 ms
 								    : LAN_IDX_FROM_SPTAG(sptag);
 		}
 		airoha_ppe_check_skb(&eth->ppe->dev, q->skb, hash, reason, false);
-		arht_ppe_multicast_handler(eth->ppe, q->skb);
+		//arht_ppe_multicast_handler(eth->ppe, q->skb);
 
 	} else {
 		if (!eth->npu) {			
